  "description": "Song Jun, who is alienated from his perfect family, buys lottery tickets every day to become independent from his family. Song Jun wins a 500 million won instant lottery ticket as he wished, and he gladly tells his perfect family about the win. However, the family is risking their lives for a seemingly worthless 500 million won lottery ticket, and Song Jun is trying to get his lottery ticket back.\n\nThe bloody feast of time-limited lottery tickets begins.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
